 lax/CAMPAIGN.md | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 25 insertions(+)

diff --git a/lax/CAMPAIGN.md b/lax/CAMPAIGN.md
index 0f16eb3..9021aec 100644
--- a/lax/CAMPAIGN.md
+++ b/lax/CAMPAIGN.md
@@ -132,6 +132,31 @@ longer bridges `id` and `fun x => x` without `Function.id_def`.
